        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Bai clan offers one as a hunting reward, it appears as a finger-sized round ball shaped Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          216
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is the rank one member of the Relic Gu series: rank one green copper, rank two red steel, rank three white silver (also called Silver Relic Gu), and rank four yellow golden Relic Gu. It is specially targeted toward rank one Gu Masters.",
        "chapters": [
          111
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_yellow_gold_relic_gu",
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Bai clan leader offers a green copper Relic Gu if Fang Yuan hunts an adult black bear during the clan hunting competition.",
        "chapters": [
          216
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bai_clan_female_leader"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After he brings back the bear skin, the Gu is sent over; he takes it and uses it at once. Fang Yuan activates his Bai clan copy on the spot and raises his cultivation from middle to upper stage. Relic Gu, with Stone Aperture Gu and other Gu, can reduce the time a Gu Master needs to raise cultivation; small realms are otherwise a matter of effort and time.",
        "chapters": [
          217
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_stone_aperture_gu",
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The same breakthrough is recalled as an instant move to rank one upper stage.",
        "chapters": [
          224
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
