  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On Jia Fu’s caravan treehouse, Gu Yue Yao Ji names green copper Relic Gu as the rank one member of the Relic Gu series beside White Silver Relic Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          111
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_jia_fu",
          "char_gu_yue_yao_ji",
          "gu_relic_gu",
          "gu_white_silver_relic_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later receives and uses one on Bai Gu Mountain.",
        "chapters": [
          217
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "loc_bai_gu_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After forming a second aperture at rank one initial stage, Fang Yuan buys green copper, red steel, white silver, and yellow gold Relic Gu in treasure yellow heaven so he can raise that aperture quickly.",
        "chapters": [
          493
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "second-aperture-purchases",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Ma Ying Jie rewards Ma Hong Yun with three green copper Relic Gu. Chang Biao notes that Ma Hong Yun reaches rank two realm in one night with the Gu he needed most, and that green copper Relic Gu are natural Gu, rare and produced at random places.",
        "chapters": [
          576
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "northern-plains-gift",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ma_ying_jie",
          "char_ma_hong_yun",
          "char_chang_biao"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Relic Gu is a sphere-shaped mortal Gu, thumb-sized, with an ordinary appearance. Its effect is to enhance the aperture walls and advance a Gu Master’s cultivation by a small realm. The mortal line runs rank one green copper Relic Gu through rank five purple crystal Relic Gu. Relic Gu form naturally and Gu Immortals cannot create them, because they are human path Gu worms with a fundamental effect on humans and variant humans.",
        "chapters": [
          1796
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "human-path-classification",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s pure dream clone uses green copper Relic Gu one after another. After the first, the rank one initial light membrane thickens into a water membrane; after the second it becomes stone membrane; after the third it becomes crystal membrane. Relic Gu are consumed in that sequence as cultivation rises. Relic Gu work on that clone because they are human path Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1796
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "human-path-classification",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique body is itself a human body, which is why human path Gu worms are effective on it.",
        "chapters": [
          1798
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "human-path-classification",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_pure_dream_reality_seeker_physique"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
